This project is run by being writing 
make
in the terminal. This will run the ROOT_to_webN.C file that produces the HTML report and the plots/animations.

OBS: it does take a couple of minutes to run, as there are a lot of plots to draw. Even if it seems to freeze, just have some patiance. 

The script to create the plots inside ROOT_to_webN.C are modified versions of
- plot_2Dhist.C
- scroll_slices.C
- plot_time_ev_2D.C

If you run these in root by them selfs, you can decide which brain slice to look at by choosing a z-value in the terminal. Remember to add an even number 0-78. 

